    "description": "A massive, heavily armored ARC unit, built around a terrifying, fully automatic minigun. It rarely moves without air support overhead, which helps it pin down and suppress Raider movement. Listen for its loud, distinct screech\u2014that's your warning before it unleashes a three-second hail of bullets toward the last known enemy position.",
